WEBVTT

00:16:27.537 --> 00:16:30.537
There's more TV shows to watch than
any human being could ever watch.

00:16:30.537 --> 00:16:33.246
There's more movies to watch than any
human being could ever watch.

00:16:33.787 --> 00:16:37.287
And we all want to watch the good stuff.
Right. And by good, I want to be clear.

00:16:37.287 --> 00:16:40.704
I don't mean pretentious. I don't mean
Oscar winning. I just mean best in class.

00:16:40.704 --> 00:16:43.746
Right. Like, if you want to
watch a weird comedy,

00:16:43.954 --> 00:16:47.037
you want to watch the best week comedy.
You want to watch the bad one. Right.

00:16:47.496 --> 00:16:51.621
Film critics, television critics. There
are deep problems with those communities.

00:16:51.621 --> 00:16:57.204
They tend to be, you know, overrepresented
by it, by white older men.

00:16:57.537 --> 00:17:03.787
But seek out critics who who consistently
have opinions that mirror your own